//@ spec: l.82, l.86
// S ≤ T where S ⊔ T = T (l.82). Two objects are of one node; their members
// are united (l.86), so {x: u8, y: u8} ⊔ {x: u8} has the members {x, y}, which
// is not {x: u8} (l.66). An object with more fields is not below one with
// fewer.
assert not le({x: u8, y: u8}, {x: u8});
